<h3>Slipstream Theme & Layout (<$text text={{{ [[$:/plugins/mblackman/slipstream]get[version]addprefix[v]] }}}/> for TiddlyWiki v5.4.0+)</h3>
<p>A modern, generic 3-column desktop reading workspace and mobile <code>fade</code> single-tiddler layout with native UI primitives.</p>
<ul>
	<li><strong>Activate Layout:</strong> Press <kbd>Ctrl+Shift+L</kbd> (or go to <em>Control Panel → Appearance → Layout</em>) and select <strong>Slipstream</strong>.</li>
	<li><strong>Documentation & Reference:</strong> View the complete [[Slipstream Knowledge Base|$:/plugins/mblackman/slipstream/docs]] for UI primitive snippets, layout guides, and customization tips.</li>
	<li><strong>Global Search &amp; Quick Switcher:</strong> Press <kbd>⌘K</kbd> / <kbd>Ctrl+K</kbd> to open the search dropdown with tiered relevance ranking, context snippets, scope pills, inline filter prefixes (<code>#tag</code>, <code>@field:val</code>, <code>&gt;[filter]</code>), and 1-click note creation.</li>
	<li><strong>Pin Any Tiddler to Left Nav:</strong> Tag any tiddler with <code>$:/tags/Pinned</code> (or customize <code>$:/config/slipstream/pinned-filter</code> in Settings). Drag-and-drop or use the Reorder buttons to arrange items; changes save to <code>$:/tags/Pinned</code> and sync across devices.</li>
	<li><strong>Resizable Desktop Sidebars:</strong> Drag the divider handle between the LeftNav or Right Inspector and the story river to resize sidebars to your liking. Double-click or press <kbd>Home</kbd> to reset to <code>272px</code>.</li>
	<li><strong>Contextual Mobile Workspace:</strong> Below <code>1024px</code>, Slipstream switches to a single-tiddler cross-fade view with an open-tiddler pill strip, contextual thumb-zone bottom bar (Edit, Context, New, Search, More), and slide-up inspector/action sheets.</li>
	<li><strong>Wide Mode for Dashboards:</strong> Add field <code>page-width: wide</code> (or tag <code>Wide</code>) to any tiddler to expand it from <code>840px</code> to <code>1120px</code>.</li>
</ul>
